; This is a forth-comment file, this is not executable as \
; the system this is built for does not support comments.
; To run this, copy it to a different file and then \
; remove everything from each semicolon to the next newline.

INTERPRET


aINTERPS @d aINTERPS 4 + @d !d ; store link pointing to the current latest_def at HERE
aINTERPS 4 + DUP @d 4 + SWAP !d ; add HERE, 4
WORD GREET FIND 4 + @d aINTERPS 4 + @d !d ; store code pointer for GREET at HERE
aINTERPS 4 + DUP @d 4 + SWAP !d ; add HERE, 4
0 aINTERPS 4 + @d !b ; give the word default behaviour
aINTERPS 4 + DUP @d 1 + SWAP !d ; add HERE, 1
63 aINTERPS 4 + @d !b ; store '?' character at HERE
aINTERPS 4 + DUP @d 1 + SWAP !d ; add HERE, 1
0 aINTERPS 4 + @d !b ; store '\000' at HERE
aINTERPS 4 + DUP @d 1 + SWAP !d ; add HERE, 1
11 aINTERPS 4 + @d - aINTERPS !d ; patch latest_def to contain the new word